  "stem": "What is the solution to the equation \\(x^{2} - 10x + 25 = 0\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "5"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "The left side is a perfect square: \\(x^{2} - 10x + 25 = (x - 5)^{2}\\).",
    "\\((x - 5)^{2} = 0\\) gives \\(x - 5 = 0\\), so \\(x = 5\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
